DTEND:20270106T154000Z
SUMMARY:✈️ 到Pearson 3号航站楼
DESCRIPTION:国际航班提前3小时到。女朋友带中国护照、美
 签（确认是多次入境M）和PR卡。
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270106T154000Z
DTEND:20270106T212400Z
SUMMARY:✈️ Porter PD 783 起飞
DESCRIPTION:约5小时44分。哥斯达黎加比多伦多晚1小时。
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270106T212400Z
DTEND:20270106T221500Z
SUMMARY:✈️ 落地利比里亚
DESCRIPTION:入境盖章（确认护照上有章），拿行李后到Adobe
 接驳点。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&que
 ry=Daniel%20Oduber%20Quir%C3%B3s%20International%20Airport
LOCATION:Daniel Oduber Quirós International Airport
GEO:10.5917;-85.5411
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Daniel Od
 uber Quirós International Airport":geo:10.5917,-85.5411
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270106T221500Z
DTEND:20270106T230000Z
SUMMARY:🚗 取车
DESCRIPTION:带实体驾照、护照和本人信用卡（押金约USD1\,000
 ）。检查车况拍照；手动确认车门锁好，这里租车被撬
 很常见。
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-4@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270106T230000Z
DTEND:20270106T233000Z
SUMMARY:🏨 到Playas del Coco入住
DESCRIPTION:约30分钟，天黑前到。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.googl
 e.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Villa%20Del%20Sol%20Boutique%20Hotel%2C%20P
 layas%20del%20Coco
LOCATION:Villa Del Sol Boutique Hotel\, Playas del Coco
GEO:10.55894;-85.690166
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Villa Del
  Sol Boutique Hotel, Playas del Coco":geo:10.55894,-85.690166
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-5@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270106T233000Z
DTEND:20270107T010000Z
SUMMARY:📸 海滩看日落
DESCRIPTION:酒店前面的海滩朝西，日落正对海面。\n\nGoogle M
 aps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Playas%20del%20Coco%2
 0Beach%2C%20Guanacaste
LOCATION:Playas del Coco Beach\, Guanacaste
GEO:10.5585;-85.6915
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Playas de
 l Coco Beach, Guanacaste":geo:10.5585,-85.6915
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-6@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270107T010000Z
DTEND:20270107T020000Z
SUMMARY:🍽️ 海边吃海鲜
DESCRIPTION:走路去Coco镇上（约15分钟），Papagayo Seafood（常
 有现场音乐）或Mar Azul；回来不想走就打车。\n\nGoogle Maps
 : https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Playas%20del%20Coco%2C%2
 0Guanacaste%2C%20Costa%20Rica
LOCATION:Playas del Coco\, Guanacaste\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.5505;-85.6995
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Playas de
 l Coco, Guanacaste, Costa Rica":geo:10.5505,-85.6995
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d1-7@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270107T020000Z
DTEND:20270107T030000Z
SUMMARY:📸 沙滩上看星星
DESCRIPTION:明天1/7是新月，今晚几乎没有月光；Guanacaste旱
 季晴天多，19:00天就全黑了。酒店前面就是Coco海滩比较
 暗的北头，走到离路灯远一点的地方，躺在毛巾上看：
 东南方高处是猎户座，下面最亮的是天狼星；21:00后往南
 方低处找老人星（全天第二亮的星，在多伦多看不到）
 。手机装Stellarium或SkyView对着天空认星。只带手机和毛巾
 ，别带贵重物品，不走远；明天要早起开山路，别熬太
 晚。\n\n月相（timeanddate）: https://www.timeanddate.com/moon/phases
 /costa-rica/liberia?year=2027\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/se
 arch/?api=1&query=Playas%20del%20Coco%20Beach%2C%20Guanacaste
LOCATION:Playas del Coco Beach\, Guanacaste
GEO:10.5585;-85.6915
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Playas de
 l Coco Beach, Guanacaste":geo:10.5585,-85.6915
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-0@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270107T130000Z
DTEND:20270107T142000Z
SUMMARY:🚗 退房出发
DESCRIPTION:带点现金（瀑布只收现金）。经Liberia、Bagaces南
 下，约1小时15分钟到瀑布。
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270107T142000Z
DTEND:20270107T152000Z
SUMMARY:📸 Llanos de Cortés 瀑布
DESCRIPTION:水泥台阶约30级、有扶绳，下面是沙地，水边和
 水里是石头。可以下水泡一会儿，踩石头时注意脚下别
 崴。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Lla
 nos%20de%20Cort%C3%A9s%20Waterfall%2C%20Bagaces
LOCATION:Llanos de Cortés Waterfall\, Bagaces
GEO:10.524302;-85.298602
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Llanos de
  Cortés Waterfall, Bagaces":geo:10.524302,-85.298602
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270107T152000Z
DTEND:20270107T190000Z
SUMMARY:🚗 沿1号公路去Monteverde
DESCRIPTION:经Cañas，转606号路上山，约2.5小时；606号路已铺
 好，上坡和急弯多，慢慢开。12:00左右到Santa Elena镇上，
 简单吃个午饭。
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270107T190000Z
DTEND:20270107T220000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ 100% Aventura 滑索
DESCRIPTION:约2.5–3小时：10条滑索，最长一条1\,590米，是哥
 斯达黎加最长的；最后两条是趴着飞的Superman线，还有一
 次Tarzan大秋千（可以不荡）。官网USD72起/人（另加税）
 ，不含接送，从镇上开车约10分钟。场次以订票页为准（
 常见8:00、11:00、13:00、15:00）。她的跟腱还在复健：Superma
 n线到站是工作人员刹停再扶着站起来，冲击不大；要留
 意的是平台之间的台阶和林间小路，以及普通滑索到站
 时偶尔要用脚踩一下平台，订之前问一下康复师。\n\n100%
  Aventura 订票（官网）: https://fareharbor.com/embeds/book/aventurac
 anopytour/items/39178/calendar/?ref=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.aventuracanopytour.c
 om&language=en-us\n100% Aventura 官网: https://www.aventuracanopytour.co
 m/\n备选：Selvatura 滑索（也有Superman线）: https://selvatura.co
 m/packages/\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=
 100%25%20Aventura%20Zipline%2C%20Monteverde
LOCATION:100% Aventura Zipline\, Monteverde
GEO:10.3388806;-84.8241529
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="100% Aven
 tura Zipline, Monteverde":geo:10.3388806,-84.8241529
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-4@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270107T220000Z
DTEND:20270107T233000Z
SUMMARY:🏨 入住Monteverde酒店
DESCRIPTION:离镇中心0.8公里；歇一会儿，换件外套：Monteverd
 e晚上只有十几度，常有风和毛毛雨。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://
 www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Hotel%20Monta%C3%B1a%20Monteverde
LOCATION:Hotel Montaña Monteverde
GEO:10.3115843;-84.816105
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Hotel Mon
 taña Monteverde":geo:10.3115843,-84.816105
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-5@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270107T233000Z
DTEND:20270108T013000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ 雨林夜间徒步
DESCRIPTION:Bajo del Tigre（儿童永恒雨林）的向导打手电带着
 走，找树蛙、蛇、蜘蛛、睡着的鸟，运气好能看到树懒
 和刺豚鼠。USD30＋税/人，最少2人；从酒店开车约5分钟。
 是林间土路，穿防滑包脚的鞋，带雨衣和驱蚊水。\n\nBajo
  del Tigre 价格与预订: https://acmcr.org/en/rates-and-reservations/\n
 备选：Monteverde云雾森林保护区夜间徒步: https://mytanfeet.co
 m/booking/monteverde-cloud-forest-reserve-night-walk/\nGoogle Maps: https:
 //www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Bajo%20del%20Tigre%2C%20Bosque%2
 0Eterno%20de%20los%20Ni%C3%B1os%2C%20Monteverde
LOCATION:Bajo del Tigre\, Bosque Eterno de los Niños\, Monteverde
GEO:10.3056389;-84.8144494
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Bajo del 
 Tigre, Bosque Eterno de los Niños, Monteverde":geo:10.3056389,-84.8144494
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d2-6@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270108T014500Z
DTEND:20270108T024500Z
SUMMARY:🍽️ 镇上吃晚饭
DESCRIPTION:在Santa Elena镇上吃，开几分钟回酒店。
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-0@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270108T130000Z
DTEND:20270108T143000Z
SUMMARY:🍽️ 早餐
DESCRIPTION:酒店含早；早上山里最清透，能看到云从山谷里
 升起来。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&que
 ry=Hotel%20Monta%C3%B1a%20Monteverde
LOCATION:Hotel Montaña Monteverde
GEO:10.3115843;-84.816105
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Hotel Mon
 taña Monteverde":geo:10.3115843,-84.816105
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270108T143000Z
DTEND:20270108T173000Z
SUMMARY:🚗 下山去La Fortuna
DESCRIPTION:沿606号路下山，经Cañas、Tilarán，沿Arenal湖北岸
 开，全程铺装路，开车约4小时；别走Monteverde–Tilarán的
 土路捷径。
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270108T173000Z
DTEND:20270108T193000Z
SUMMARY:📸 Arenal湖北岸
DESCRIPTION:沿Route 142的弯路开，路边观景停车处拍湖和火山
 ；在Nuevo Arenal吃午饭。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps
 /search/?api=1&query=Nuevo%20Arenal%2C%20Guanacaste%2C%20Costa%20Rica
LOCATION:Nuevo Arenal\, Guanacaste\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.547;-84.863736
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Nuevo Are
 nal, Guanacaste, Costa Rica":geo:10.547,-84.863736
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270108T193000Z
DTEND:20270108T210000Z
SUMMARY:🏨 到Termales del Arenal入住
DESCRIPTION:全程白天开完。房间收拾好就先泡酒店的温泉池
 。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Termal
 es%20del%20Arenal%2C%20La%20Fortuna
LOCATION:Termales del Arenal\, La Fortuna
GEO:10.478292;-84.672823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Termales 
 del Arenal, La Fortuna":geo:10.478292,-84.672823
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-4@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270108T210000Z
DTEND:20270109T003000Z
SUMMARY:♨️ 泡酒店温泉
DESCRIPTION:先泡一会儿，傍晚去镇上吃饭。\n\nGoogle Maps: http
 s://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Termales%20del%20Arenal%2C%20L
 a%20Fortuna
LOCATION:Termales del Arenal\, La Fortuna
GEO:10.478292;-84.672823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Termales 
 del Arenal, La Fortuna":geo:10.478292,-84.672823
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d3-5@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270109T003000Z
DTEND:20270109T013000Z
SUMMARY:🍽️ 镇上吃晚饭
DESCRIPTION:Snapper's House就在镇中心；吃完开5分钟回酒店。\n
 \nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=La%20Fortun
 a%2C%20San%20Carlos%2C%20Costa%20Rica
LOCATION:La Fortuna\, San Carlos\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.471683;-84.644436
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="La Fortun
 a, San Carlos, Costa Rica":geo:10.471683,-84.644436
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-0@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270109T120000Z
DTEND:20270109T133000Z
SUMMARY:📸 早起看火山
DESCRIPTION:早上6–9点火山最可能露脸，从酒店就能看。
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270109T133000Z
DTEND:20270109T180000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ Peñas Blancas 安全漂流
DESCRIPTION:酒店接送；坐在充气筏上由导游掌舵，基本不用
 划（有的团会让你轻轻划几下），约2小时看树懒、猴子
 、凯门鳄和鸟，11:00左右回来。上下筏子在河岸边，岸上
 可能有泥和石头，注意脚下，穿防滑包脚的水鞋。\n\nFort
 una Welcome 河上漂流 · USD70含接送 · 7:30出发约4小时: https:
 //www.fortunawelcome.com/la-fortuna-tours/safari-float-penas-blancas-river
 /\n备选：Desafío 河上漂流 · USD72＋税含接送 · 8:00开始约
 3小时，要轻轻划几下: https://www.desafiocostarica.com/service/saf
 ari-float-penas-blancas/\n备选：Two Weeks in Costa Rica 河上漂流 ·
  1月起USD69＋税含接送 · 7:30出发约4.5小时: https://www.twowee
 ksincostarica.com/product/safari-float-penas-blancas-river-group-tour/\nGo
 ogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Pe%C3%B1as%20Bl
 ancas%20River%2C%20San%20Carlos%2C%20Costa%20Rica
LOCATION:Peñas Blancas River\, San Carlos\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.39;-84.58
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Peñas Bl
 ancas River, San Carlos, Costa Rica":geo:10.39,-84.58
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270109T180000Z
DTEND:20270109T200000Z
SUMMARY:🍽️ 镇上午餐
DESCRIPTION:Cevichería D'Mora吃ceviche。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.goo
 gle.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=La%20Fortuna%2C%20San%20Carlos%2C%20Costa
 %20Rica
LOCATION:La Fortuna\, San Carlos\, Costa Rica
GEO:10.471683;-84.644436
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="La Fortun
 a, San Carlos, Costa Rica":geo:10.471683,-84.644436
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270109T200000Z
DTEND:20270109T223000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ Mistico 吊桥公园
DESCRIPTION:开车约25分钟。3.2公里环线，有缓坡、台阶，吊
 桥会晃，约2小时。跟着前面的向导团走，常能看到睫毛
 蝮蛇这类小动物。上下坡注意脚下。最后入园15:50。\n\nMi
 stico官网: https://misticopark.com/\n备选：Mistico 向导团（自然
 史步道） · USD44＋税 · 约2.5小时，向导带着找动物: https
 ://misticopark.com/tours/natural-history-walk/\n备选：Fortuna Welcome 
 吊桥向导团 · USD70含接送和门票 · 14:00出发约4小时: https
 ://www.fortunawelcome.com/la-fortuna-tours/arenal-hanging-bridges-tour/\n
 备选：Sky Adventures 吊桥（El Castillo，开车约40分钟） · 要
 提前预约: https://skyadventures.travel/hanging-bridges/\nGoogle Maps: 
 https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Mistico%20Arenal%20Hanging
 %20Bridges%20Park
LOCATION:Mistico Arenal Hanging Bridges Park
GEO:10.488049;-84.753777
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Mistico A
 renal Hanging Bridges Park":geo:10.488049,-84.753777
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d4-4@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270109T223000Z
DTEND:20270110T003000Z
SUMMARY:♨️ 回酒店泡温泉
DESCRIPTION:吊桥回来先泡一会儿，再出门吃晚饭。\n\nGoogle M
 aps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Termales%20del%20Aren
 al%2C%20La%20Fortuna
LOCATION:Termales del Arenal\, La Fortuna
GEO:10.478292;-84.672823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Termales 
 del Arenal, La Fortuna":geo:10.478292,-84.672823
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
