SUMMARY:🍽️ 镇上吃晚饭
DESCRIPTION:开5分钟去镇上：Snapper's House（马林鱼ceviche、海
 鲜汤）或Cevichería D'Mora；吃完开回酒店。\n\nGoogle Maps: htt
 ps://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=La%20Fortuna%2C%20San%20Carlo
 s%2C%20Costa%20Rica
LOCATION:La Fortuna\, San Carlos\, Costa Rica
