DTSTART:20270110T133000Z
DTEND:20270110T140000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ 酒店接人（骑马团）
DESCRIPTION:早上火山最容易露脸。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.goog
 le.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Termales%20del%20Arenal%2C%20La%20Fortuna
LOCATION:Termales del Arenal\, La Fortuna
GEO:10.478292;-84.672823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Termales 
 del Arenal, La Fortuna":geo:10.478292,-84.672823
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d5-1@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270110T140000Z
DTEND:20270110T170000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ 骑马看Arenal火山
DESCRIPTION:约2.5小时骑行，林间和牧场路线，到火山观景点
 和Los Lirios湖，向导会先教。注意：脚踩马镫时脚跟往下
 压、上下马要单脚蹬地，跟腱会吃力一点，觉得紧就让
 马慢走。\n\nFortuna Welcome 骑马团: https://www.fortunawelcome.com/
 la-fortuna-tours/arenal-volcano-horseback-riding-tour\n备选：Mistico「
 Paco’s Horses」骑马 · USD58＋税 · 8:15开始约2.5小时，会骑
 马过河: https://misticopark.com/tours/pacos-horses/\n备选：Don Tobia
 s 骑马上火山观景点 · 8:30开始约3小时，含接送，价格要
 问: https://www.arenal.net/tours/don-tobias-horseback-ride-volcano
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d5-2@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270110T173000Z
DTEND:20270110T190000Z
SUMMARY:🍽️ 回酒店换衣服、吃午饭
DESCRIPTION:在酒店或镇上吃个简单的午饭，13:00树懒团来接
 。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Termal
 es%20del%20Arenal%2C%20La%20Fortuna
LOCATION:Termales del Arenal\, La Fortuna
GEO:10.478292;-84.672823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Termales 
 del Arenal, La Fortuna":geo:10.478292,-84.672823
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:costa-rica-2027-jan-6-11-d5-3@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T193407Z
DTSTART:20270110T190000Z
DTEND:20270110T220000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ 树懒团
DESCRIPTION:向导带着在农场林间的平缓小路上找树懒，常能
 看到二趾和三趾树懒，还有鸟、蛙和蜂鸟；约2.5–3小时
 ，难度标为「容易」，含酒店接送。USD90/人含税，最少2
 人成团。\n\nFortuna Welcome 树懒团: https://www.fortunawelcome.com/
 la-fortuna-tours/arenal-sloth-tour/\n备选：Fortuna Welcome 树懒＋农
 场午餐（约6小时）: https://www.fortunawelcome.com/la-fortuna-tours
 /sloth-watching-campesino-farmer-tour
END:VEVENT
