 间（还车要加满），13:15前到。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.goog
 le.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Nuevo%20Arenal%2C%20Guanacaste%2C%20Costa%
 20Rica
LOCATION:Nuevo Arenal\, Guanacaste\, Costa Rica
