SUMMARY:🚗 还车，坐接驳车到机场
DESCRIPTION:离境税一般已含在机票里。回程由Air Transat执飞
 ，去Air Transat柜台值机、托运；国际航班起飞前2.5–3小
 时到最稳。\n\nGoogle Maps: https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&
 query=Daniel%20Oduber%20Quir%C3%B3s%20International%20Airport
LOCATION:Daniel Oduber Quirós International Airport
GEO:10.5917;-85.5411
